      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "```None\n// `N` is the length given in the setup.\n// `h` is the input array that contains real numbers.\n// `H` is the output array that contains real numbers.\n\nFor 0 <= k < N\n    Or[k] = Ir[0]/2\n        + sum(Ir[j] * cos((k+1/2) * j * pi / N), 1 <= j < N)\n```",
