      "normalizedSource": "```None // `N` is the length given in the setup. // `h` is the input array that contains real numbers. // `H` is the output array that contains real numbers. For 0 <= k < N Or[k] = Ir[0]/2 + sum(Ir[j] * cos((k+1/2) * j * pi / N), 1 <= j < N) ```",
